<title>USA: HOUSTON INDUSTRIES COMPLETES NORAM MERGER.</title>
<headline>HOUSTON INDUSTRIES COMPLETES NORAM MERGER.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Houston Industries Inc said its merger with NorAm Energy Corp, announced in August 1996, was completed Wednesday, creating one of the largest combined electric and natural gas companies in the nation, with assets of nearly $18 billion and annual revenues of about $9 billion.</p>
<p>The merged company will operate under the name Houston Industries and will continue to be traded on the New York, Chicago and London stock exchanges under the stock symbol HOU.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
